1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Let's be real — React is a library, not a framework. And Next.js stole its throne.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Stack Overflow 2024 survey: Next.js is top 3 most-loved. React is just the foundation underneath.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:26,000
We used to hack routing, state, and SEO manually in React. Next.js ships all of it built-in.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Netflix, TikTok, Twitch — all running on Next.js. Pure React in production is rare now.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Next.js Developer job postings up 40% in a year. React is the foundation — Next.js is the house.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
React isn't dead — but using it alone? That's the real mistake.

7
